# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BookmarkBridge — .gitignore (macOS / Xcode / Swift)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

## Xcode — build & derived data
build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode — user-specific state (must NOT be versioned)
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Xcode — shared schemes are kept; user schemes are ignored above.
## To share a scheme, mark it "Shared" in Xcode (writes to xcshareddata/).

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
Package.resolved

## CocoaPods (not used today; ignored preventively)
Pods/

## Carthage (not used today; ignored preventively)
Carthage/Build/

## Fastlane (if adopted later)
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

## Testing / coverage
*.xcresult/
coverage/

## Secrets & local config (never commit)
*.env
.env.local
secrets.plist
*.p12
*.mobileprovision

## Editor / tooling
.idea/
*.swp
*~
